  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n\n- Typed Fable bindings for JavaScript Temporal, including instants, zoned date-times, calendar dates, wall-clock times, and durations.\n- Typed construction, arithmetic, rounding, calendar, and time-zone options with nanosecond precision.\n- Result-returning operations, error classification, and F# comparison helpers.\n- Support for application-supplied Temporal implementations and native Temporal.[Unreleased]: https://github.com/olivercoad/Fable.Temporal/compare/v0.1.0...HEAD[0.1.0]: https://github.com/olivercoad/Fable.Temporal/releases/tag/v0.1.0",
